{"at":"2026-10-13T22:55:54.215Z","id":"e1d9a3ccdf5eeca54d221d04163d2538ca164105c486e4ecac8482795daa7c91","kind":"evidence","paths":["testing/web-platform/tests/css/CSS2/generated-content/content-016.xht"],"repository":"git:314d8065c5ad68c7e5c5f92d","source":{"evidenceOnly":true,"reference":"https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/blob/1a097ed8d31f6b307a5d0ebc34a82ceaf7f3727b/testing/web-platform/tests/css/CSS2/generated-content/content-016.xht#L1-L27","status":"provisional","type":"shared-note"},"text":"# testing/web-platform/tests/css/CSS2/generated-content/content-016.xht:1-27: source evidence\n\nExact source at 1a097ed8d31f6b307a5d0ebc34a82ceaf7f3727b. This excerpt does not establish a behavioral interpretation or test result.\n\n[Original source](https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/blob/1a097ed8d31f6b307a5d0ebc34a82ceaf7f3727b/testing/web-platform/tests/css/CSS2/generated-content/content-016.xht#L1-L27)\n\n~~~\n<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Strict//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-strict.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n    <head>\n        <title>CSS Test: Content using a 'counter()' function with a list style set to 'armenian'</title>\n        <link rel=\"author\" title=\"Microsoft\" href=\"http://www.microsoft.com/\" />\n        <link rel=\"help\" href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/CSS21/generate.html#propdef-content\" />\n        <link rel=\"help\" href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/CSS21/generate.html#content\" />\n        <link rel=\"match\" href=\"content-016-ref.html\" />\n        <meta name=\"assert\" content=\"The 'content' property properly handles a 'counter()' function with a list-style.\" />\n        <style type=\"text/css\">\n            div:before\n            {\n                counter-increment: test;\n                content: counter(test, armenian);\n            }\n            div\n            {\n                border: 2px solid black;\n                height: 30px;\n            }\n        </style>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n        <p>Test passes if there is an Armenian character \"&#x0531;\" below.</p>\n        <div></div>\n    </body>\n</html>\n~~~","title":"testing/web-platform/tests/css/CSS2/generated-content/content-016.xht:1-27: source evidence","version":1,"visibility":"shared"}
